s:552:"<strong>Informazioni di debug:</strong> Unknown column 'u.teacher' in 'order clause'<br />SELECT u.id, odu.user_id, odu.admin, odu.teacher, odu.editor,<br />                    u.firstname, u.lastname<br />                    FROM mdl_local_odysseus_user odu <br />                    LEFT JOIN mdl_user u ON odu.user_id = u.id<br />                    WHERE (odu.activity_id = ?) <br />                    ORDER BY u.teacher DESC, odu.admin DESC, u.lastname, u.firstname<br />[array (<br />  0 =&gt; '1',<br />)]<br />Error code: dmlreadexception";